{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>阿Sa蔡卓妍昨日（11月22日）迎來44歲生日，經理人霍汶希（Mani）於社交平台分享多張慶生合照，Sa爸及阿Sa老公林俊賢（Elvis）亦在場慶祝。Mani發文稱「三喜臨門」，一度惹起網民對阿Sa「造人成功」的揣測，看來大家都十分關心阿Sa肚皮！生日會上眾人為阿Sa送上蛋糕，日前蛋糕店店主發文爆原來蛋糕是由Elvis特意訂製給阿Sa，更指定要寫上這句說話，冧到爆！</p><figure><img alt=\"阿Sa老公Elvis意外搶fo。（IG@manifokfok）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1202030526207102976825694.jpeg/purjcutuoPSQWY-vl6yXsTqUGFvddSJOeiOI4XojiOE\"/><figcaption>阿Sa老公Elvis意外搶fo。（IG@manifokfok）</figcaption></figure><p>阿Sa老公訂製蛋糕示愛</p><p>日前為阿Sa製作蛋糕的店主在Instagram上載影片，分享蛋糕製作過程，由公仔到餅底都是店主悉心準備，最後更擺上燈飾，「閃令令」着燈，充滿心思。蛋糕店店主發文透露，原來是Elvis特意為阿Sa訂製生日蛋糕，Elvis更指定要寫上「Happy Birthday My Love」，難掩對阿Sa的愛意！</p><figure><img alt=\"蔡卓妍生日與經理人Mani、Sa爸及老公一同留家簡單慶生。（IG@manifokfok）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1202030789114466304109624.jpeg/iqZ2_ifCkgz46GdGbJpZZNpNe2nmOtGi0-VgBNPlYAQ\"/><figcaption>蔡卓妍生日與經理人Mani、Sa爸及老公一同留家簡單慶生。（IG@manifokfok）</figcaption></figure><p>蛋糕店店主發文：「林生 @elvischunyinlam 訂俾林太 @choisaaaa 阿Sa的生日蛋糕 諗起佢哋兩公婆就諗起充滿愛、心形蛋糕，再加上林生想係蛋糕上面寫：Happy Birthday My Love，嘩（帶返副太陽眼鏡先）」阿Sa亦留言感謝店主：「Thank you again❤️❤️」Elvis亦豎起手指公激讚好味：「好靚呀個蛋糕整得，又好食👍🏻👍🏻」。</p><figure><img alt=\"蛋糕店店主分享製作阿Sa蛋糕的過程。（IG@pandora_cake_shop）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1202031378045210624062493.png/ZjdKwVdnDeHc2uTrlzT2cXBGIbD-43Ej_M_z-_zP8_s\"/><figcaption>蛋糕店店主分享製作阿Sa蛋糕的過程。（IG@pandora_cake_shop）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蛋糕店店主分享製作阿Sa蛋糕的過程。（IG@pandora_cake_shop）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1202031375583023104051469.png/q6npp7esUzDl-38kdxQM5NrS7IOqMYWxBglSewYJUns\"/><figcaption>蛋糕店店主分享製作阿Sa蛋糕的過程。（IG@pandora_cake_shop）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"用足心機。（IG@pandora_cake_shop）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1202031401038778368604752.png/EcT3WcNUqPxI-fCPCs1h29Axd9GiyK3TdCLONXQizjU\"/><figcaption>用足心機。（IG@pandora_cake_shop）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"還可以着燈。（IG@pandora_cake_shop）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1202031398467538944371584.png/F-wGf_0iwOHfIJYoU7612_k7xD0Pgd0Cp0e316dHt9c\"/><figcaption>還可以着燈。（IG@pandora_cake_shop）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好用心機！（IG@pandora_cake_shop）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1202031395900493824240917.png/Jo5HLi42yH9-9JyuahGPJpdXvn3ikgNwS8ez3EvHs9w\"/><figcaption>好用心機！（IG@pandora_cake_shop）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Elvis用蛋糕向阿Sa示愛。（IG@pandora_cake_shop）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1202031393773850624925840.png/B25xjYx1y0pbhgNxX2qhv6eATv_SMq1WrU11Da1NdQ0\"/><figcaption>Elvis用蛋糕向阿Sa示愛。（IG@pandora_cake_shop）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"阿Sa及Elvis留言多謝店主。（IG@pandora_cake_shop）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1202031391408132096326189.png/Z8M_owZ-4bhqAv23-HGj7I9ohIRhLpzqBs23FQbNtxU\"/><figcaption>阿Sa及Elvis留言多謝店主。（IG@pandora_cake_shop）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T16:24:25.041411+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":857,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T15:59:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T02:36:20.959840+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T16:17:50.674550+00:00","content_hash":"8e8c5d199254f84537daf52b8b7d53593900d91b1e7a3dbaee99adb3649cf1a3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}